# .mailmap — canonical author/committer identity for this repository.
#
# The maintainer renamed their GitHub account from CinQwQeggs01 to QuinOvaX.
# GitHub attributes commits to an account by *email*, and the contributors
# graph shows the account's current login — so the rename already fixes how
# the project page reads. This file only normalises the names shown by
# `git log`, `git shortlog`, `git blame` and `git describe` locally.
#
# It does NOT rewrite history and does NOT touch existing (signed) commits.
# See: https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap
#
# Syntax: Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>

# Canonical identity.
